Copyright 2026 Hydor Devs

Hydor was created by Chris Samarinas (https://algoprog.com).
https://github.com/algoprog/hydor · https://hydor.app

The handwriting styles for typed signatures (web/src/features/signatures/fonts/) are the
fonts Dancing Script, Mr Dafoe, Mr De Haviland and Mynerve, unchanged but for WOFF
compression, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; each keeps that licence beside it.

The font text is written in when PDF forms are filled (server/documents/pdf/fonts/) is Liberation Sans,
unchanged, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, which it keeps beside it.

Some of the bundled skills (in skills/) are adapted from Magnus Hedemark's
agent-skills collection, under the MIT License; each keeps that licence in
its own LICENSE.txt.
